\par\par \b \uc2  MAS confirms  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  to curb S'pore dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juli 1999\par 06:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE - July 7 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore (MAS) said on Wednesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday to curb the rise of the Singapore dollar. \par \par \uc2  "Yes, we have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , just as we \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the downside last year when people were unduly pessimistic, so to we have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the upside," said Yeo Lian Sim, MAS assistant managing director of capital markets. \par \par \uc2  "It seemed the move (in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) was not warranted and it seemed the speed of the movement was going ahead of the economy," Yeo told a news conference. \par \par \uc2  She declined to give details on the extent of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Yeo said further action would depend on moves in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and their impact on the trade weighted basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against which the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  manages the Singapore dollar. \par \par \uc2  MAS officials added that they were not concerned about the value of the yen against the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  sharply to keep yen strength on a tight leash, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been buoyed by signs of domestic economic recovery in Japan. \par \par \uc2  "We are all very comfortable with the yen at its current exchange rate," Khor Ho Eee, senior executive director of economics at the MAS, told reporters. \par \par \uc2  ((Singapore Newsroom +65 870-3080; Fax +65 776-8112; email: singapore.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv7704xjj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
