\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo -2: BOJ Likely To Assist Any Yen Slide \b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juli 1999\par 02:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Underpinning concern over \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Haruhiko Kuroda, the head of the international bureau at \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  - and soon-to-be vice finance minister for international affairs - said he is closely watching movements in the dollar/yen and the euro/yen even more closely than before. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the BOJ will likely act promptly to put a stop to any appreciation of the yen, and will more than likely grease the slide if the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  starts slipping lower. \par \par \uc2  "I think the BOJ wants to put the yen on a depreciating trend," Sakura's Sekioka said. "If the yen starts to strengthen, the BOJ will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Or if the dollar goes over Y122.50, I think there is a chance that the BOJ will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to push it higher." \par \par \uc2  The euro is also getting support from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  concerns. But the euro's rise is seen capped around Y125.50 by sell orders from Japanese investors, said a Tokyo-based European bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  At 0000 GMT, the euro was trading at Y125.23, up from Y124.95 in New York late Tuesday. The euro was quoted late in Tokyo Tuesday at Y124.64. \par \par \uc2  Sterling was at $1.5635, up from $1.5622 in New York late Tuesday. Sterling was at $1.5753 in Tokyo late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Arran Scott; 813-5255-2984; amscott@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 07-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0040GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv77053nn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
