\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar sharply higher vs yen on BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 1999\par 08:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO July 5 (Reuters) - The dollar was sharply higher against the yen by late Tokyo trade on Monday as Japanese monetary authorities \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and key economic data was weaker than expected. \par \par \uc2  But as monetary authorities attempted to give the greenback a boost through intermittent dollar-buying, fund flows into Japanese assets and steady selling from Japanese exporters tempered its rise. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was quoted at 122.43/50 yen as of 0615 GMT, compared with 121.01/04 in early Tokyo before the BOJ's action. The dollar was at 120.092/02 yen late in New York on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) was detected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets early in the Tokyo morning after the release of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's closely watched "tankan" corporate sentiment survey. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the BOJ may have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  from levels below 121.50 yen to around 121.80 yen. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen buying continuously near 122.10/20 yen, chasing the greenback to around 122.35 yen, they said. \par \par \uc2  "The initial reaction to the tankan was one of disappointment, as market expectations had been bloated after strong first-quarter growth data," a dealer at a city bank said. \par \par \uc2  The tankan showed the key diffusion index (DI) for major manufacturers was minus 37, up from minus 47 in the previous March tankan but slightly lower than a consensus forecast of minus 36. \par \par \uc2  "So the BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by cleverly riding a wave of short-covering immediately after the tankan results," a dealer at a Japanese commercial bank said. \par \par \uc2  Senior \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  official Haruhiko Kuroda, who this week is expected to succeed Eisuke Sakakibara as vice minister for international affairs, confirmed that Tokyo authorities had acted in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday morning. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv75055xo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
