\par\par \b \uc2  Nikkei, JGBs gain on 'tankan',dollar lifted by BOJ. \b0\par\par\uc2 581 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 1999\par 04:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, July 5 (Reuters) - Tokyo stocks rallied solidly on Monday after the Bank of Japan's (BOJ) much awaited quarterly "tankan" survey showed an improvement in business sentiment. \par \par \uc2  The benchmark Nikkei 225 average ended the morning up 282.13 points or 1.57 percent at 18,214.60. But Japanese government bonds (JGB) were also firmer as the data was not strong enough to fuel speculation of an early end to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's zero interest policy. \par \par \uc2  The key September 10-year JGB futures contract was up 0.05 at 131.40 by midday, but off its earlier high of 131.85 \par \par \uc2  The dollar jumped one and half yen to 122.40 yen from an earlier low of 120.90 yen, as the tankan was not as strong as some players had bet and as the BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars for the yen, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. The tankan for June showed that the business outlook among large manufacturers had improved for the second consecutive quarter after showing a positive upturn in March for the first time in almost two years. \par \par \uc2  The closely watched large manufacturer's diffusion index (DI) was reported at minus 37, compared with minus 47 in the previous poll three months ago. "The DI itself is not a surprise. It is not the kind of figure that will hurt our expectations that Japanese stocks will gradually head higher in the long term," said Hiroshi Arano, director at Dai-Ichi Kangyo Asset Management. \par \par \uc2  He said the rise in big manufacturers' profit outlook for 1999/00 was supportive for the stock market. \par \par \uc2  Although the tankan showed an improvement, it also showed that the economy was not yet healthy enough for the BOJ to alter its ultra-easy credit stance in the near term, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  Kazuo Mizuno, manager at Kokusai Securities Economic Research Department, said: "The tankan shows that business sentiment has not yet recovered at a pace suggestive of the initial stages of an economic recovery." \par \par \uc2  "A change in the Bank of Japan's zero interest rate policy is not likely in the near future." Against such a backdrop, the yield of the cash 10-year JGB was likely to remain below the 1.99 percent set last week over the next three months, Mizuno said. The yield of the 1.8 percent 214th 10-year JGB was at 1.665 percent, compared with 1.660 percent late on Friday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was at 122.06/09 yen at 0230 GMT after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aggressive dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Senior Finance Ministry official Haruhiko Kuroda confirmed that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had acted in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market earlier on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ was detected to have bought dollars above 122 yen to as far as around 122.30/40 yen. Bankers said the BOJ was seen to be buying continuously above 122 yen. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the BOJ may have started buying from the levels from below 121.50. \par \par \uc2  But Takehiro Sato, assistant manager of the treasury group at Sumitomo Bank, said he expected yen-buying pressures to build up again on speculation that the BOJ might lift its current zero-interest rate policy. \par \par \uc2  "The diffusion index forecasts for September indicate that firms are optimistic for the second half of the current fiscal year, unlike economists' views for an economic downturn," Sato said. ((Tokyo Treasury Desk, +81-3-3432-9780 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv75051mf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
