\par\par \b \uc2  REPEAT:Dlr-Yen Supported By BOJ Covert  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Rumor \b0\par\par\uc2 573 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 1999\par 00:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  By Ron Harui \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--A rumor has been running through the Tokyo \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , nervous that its recent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  might not keep the dollar buoyed for long, is "covertly" buying small amounts of dollars from select banks, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Although the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on the rumor, and traders haven't been able to confirm whether the BOJ has actually conducted such deals, the mere talk of such action has given support to the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , they said. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be using covert \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the market around the Y120 level as needed, but this is impossible to confirm," said Taisuke Tanaka, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at Credit Suisse First Boston, who doubts the rumors. \par \par \uc2  Such speculation was buttressed by a report in Thursday's Nikkei Financial Daily, which said that the BOJ might have secretly bought dollars last Monday and Tuesday. Traders noted that the dollar rose suddenly during those sessions, despite the absence of any notable dollar-supportive factors. \par \par \uc2  According to the rumor, the BOJ's veiled \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  were much smaller in scope than its overt \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which are estimated to have totaled $20 billion. \par \par \uc2  "It's really hard to say, but the BOJ may have spent only a few hundred million dollars each time it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  covertly," said a dealer at a European bank. "Small amounts help to make the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  a covert one." \par \par \uc2  The trader added that there were unusual bids around the Y120.50 level in Asian trade Friday, though he didn't know whether the bids were from the BOJ. \par \par \uc2  Market participants speculate that if the BOJ is in fact conducting such behind the scene deals, it's because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is worried the dollar will begin to weaken in coming sessions. \par \par \uc2  With the Nikkei average of 225 shares briefly rising above 18000 Friday for the first time since September 1997, and the BOJ's "tankan" survey of business sentiment expected to show improvement, there is still strong upward pressure on the yen. \par \par \uc2  Economists expect the tankan's confidence index for major manufacturers - to be released Monday - will improve to around minus 35 from minus 47 three months ago. \par \par \uc2  Japan's government is seen worried that a rise in the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could take the wind out of the nascent economic recovery and worsen deflationary pressures, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "One reason for covert \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the BOJ would be to protect its reputation in the marketplace. If the market goes against the BOJ each time it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  and tests the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resolve, the BOJ might not be able to keep its reputation," said Kenneth Landon, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Deutsche Bank in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  Tanaka noted that the BOJ has carried out covert \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  via major Japanese commercial banks in the past, though it hasn't often relied on such a strategy. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Even if the BOJ is secretly \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , traders said it won't\par effectively support the dollar for long because the bids would be too\par small. Still, the talk has helped prevent a further slide in the U.S.\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . In Tokyo Friday the dollar was trading around Y121.00, well\par above Y120, which is considered the bottom line of the BOJ's comfort\par zone for the dollar.\par -By Ron Harui; 813-5255-2942; rharuiap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-07-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2210GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv740514y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
