\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  IN EUROPE - Confident dollar pauses for breath. \b0\par\par\uc2 578 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 1999\par 17:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, July 2 (Reuters) - The dollar consolidated after setting highs against European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday and continued to find support against the yen after the U.S. employment report and this week's U.S. rate hike. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, dollar/Swiss rose to an eight-year high at 1.5720, and sterling fell to a 23-month low at $1.5699. Those moves took the euro close its $1.0201 alltime low set on Thursday. "Everything came back from the brink," said Kit Juckes, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at NatWest Global. "The dollar is supported in the sense that since the rate hike, provided U.S. assets do well, the dollar will do well." \par \par \uc2  The euro was at $1.0224/28 by 1450 GMT, off a high of $1.0252 seen after the euro bounced from a low of $1.0210. In late European trade on Thursday the euro was at $1.0237/42. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/Swiss was at 1.5695/00 versus 1.5682/92 late in Europe on Thursday. Sterling was at $1.5770/75 compared with $1.5772/82 in late European trade yesterday. \par \par \uc2  The euro has fallen by nearly 16 percent against the dollar since its peak of $1.1906, reached a few hours after its launch in January. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said with a better outlook for European growth an end could be in sight for the euro's longterm downtrend. \par \par \uc2  "Nearly all the good news is in the dollar so how much more you'll get from the U.S. side is hard to tell and the economic news in Europe is becoming increasingly euro friendly," said Juckes. \par \par \uc2  "There is a risk of a final spike down as the market gets itself short and pushes for a big break of parity, but I suspect that the economic news is there to justify a pretty sharp correction if the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  turns it around." \par \par \uc2  Michael Rottmann, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Hypovereinsbank in Munich did not expect euro/dollar to reach parity and saw a slight bounce over the coming week to around $1.0350. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/yen was at broadly steady at 121.03/12, having traded in a range between 121.25 and 120.75 supported by continuing fears of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Analysts said some yen weakness could be expected but little was likely to happen ahead of a long weekend in the United States and Japan's second quarter tankan report on Monday. \par \par \uc2  "A weaker yen will not be dependent on the tankan's outcome becasue if we get a strong increase on the tankan then the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will step in with some \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Rottmann. \par \par \uc2  "However, if there is a weaker tankan reading I would expect the yen to weaken without any kind of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  In a Reuters survey of forecasts compiled on Thursday, 18 economists expected the key manufacturers' diffusion index to improve by 11 points to minus 36, with forecasts ranging from minus 41 to minus 27. \par \par \uc2  Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  official Esiuke Sakakibara said overnight that the ministry was particularly watching the euro/yen rate. \par \par \uc2  The euro was last at 123.93/06 yen, after visiting its near two-week low at 123.51 yen set on Thursday during the euro's earlier bout of weakness. ((Deepthi Wickremasinghe, London Capital Markets, +44 171 542 4040, fax +44 171 542 5285, deepthi.wickremasinghe@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv72058na\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
