\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: Some See Chance Of Euro-Yen  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 1999\par 08:09\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Some traders said it was significant that Sakakibara mentioned the euro-yen, as that might suggest that there is a possibility that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market later during the European session to support the euro against the yen. \par \par \uc2  Many in the market feel that the euro is much weaker against the yen than what's perceived as a comfort zone by Japanese monetary authorities, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "Because the dollar/yen gets dragged down by falls in euro/yen, it's surprising that they're not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at these levels," said Inoue. "It's possible they're waiting to do so in Europe, or after the tankan." \par \par \uc2  The European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy euros for yen on behalf of the BOJ on June 21 near current levels, bringing the euro above Y127. \par \par \uc2  "The BOJ needs to coordinate with the ECB, so if they \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  it would probably be overseas," said Kazuo Watanabe, deputy general manager of the treasury department at Sumitomo Bank. He added that the BOJ wouldn't opt to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in such a thin market - though it would be highly effective - as that would cause an upheaval and destroy market mechanisms. \par \par \uc2  Against the yen, the euro was quoted at Y123.75, up from Y123.64 in New York late Thursday but below Y123.82 in London late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Sterling was at $1.5755, up from $1.5735 in New York late Thursday. Sterling was at $1.5766 in London late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By Chang-Ran Kim; 813-5255-2933; ckim@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0609GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv7204y4b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
