\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo:Dlr Up A Bit As  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Anticipated \b0\par\par\uc2 304 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juni 1999\par 02:15\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--The dollar is up slightly in early Tokyo Wednesday as anticipation for another Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  prompts some speculators to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  while preventing some others from selling it aggressively. \par \par \uc2  Volume was relatively thin in New York overnight as market players stayed sidelined, unwilling to test the dollar lower to see at what levels the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again. \par \par \uc2  Dealers say the market is still fundamentally inclined to sell dollars for yen, but is unable to do so freely with the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - even at the current level of around Y122 - hanging in the air. In particular, options-related dollar-selling demand from exporters and yen-buying demand from foreigners to invest in Japanese stocks are being detained by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought dollars above this level, so it wouldn't be surprising if it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again," said a dealer at a Japanese trust bank. \par \par \uc2  In the meantime, institutional investors speculating that the BOJ will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  are buying dollars to some extent, aiming to take profit once the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  jacks up the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. However, if \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't come in, they're likely to quickly drop the dollar somewhere along the line, one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ usually conducts its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  after 0000 GMT. \par \par \uc2  At 0005 GMT (8:05 p.m. EDT Sunday), the dollar was trading at Y121.95 above Y121.74 in New York late Tuesday. The dollar was quoted at Y121.94 late in Tokyo Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The euro is trading at $1.0342, above $1.0325 late Tuesday in New York. The euro was at $1.0338 in Tokyo late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 23-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0015GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 1863 4162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6n04ptc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
